{"steam_appid":2820820,"steam_name":"Jotunnslayer: Hordes of Hel","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2820820/736493144/649fd2cd4239f134b91d37773d3f29229c97e4a1/1775720393/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1775739406","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257311825/7b0b42f9a38df4f310e199ba071e4d47a97ac180/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1775739406","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820820/9103b05d68d9af42da9efb4cee30ffb1f681e679/ss_9103b05d68d9af42da9efb4cee30ffb1f681e679.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784209296","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820820/865649a81d21ae3b4befea1e6f46e73a30f9a272/ss_865649a81d21ae3b4befea1e6f46e73a30f9a272.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784209296","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820820/1bedaa38cb7cfc4bc42bc003f998c80b51235ca8/ss_1bedaa38cb7cfc4bc42bc003f998c80b51235ca8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784209296","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820820/18c4202ad81f3aedbe0e9c3b05aaa7701e023578/ss_18c4202ad81f3aedbe0e9c3b05aaa7701e023578.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784209296","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820820/a7722642eaaafc371012d58a55d6a1658ba03d04/ss_a7722642eaaafc371012d58a55d6a1658ba03d04.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784209296"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jotunnslayer: Hordes of Hel</strong> is a gripping roguelike, horde-survivor game with top-notch graphics. Choose one of the damned heroes and attempt to pass the Gods' test by fighting your way through waves of mythical adversaries.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you succeed in all the trials, you will become the chosen Jotunnslayer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820820/extras/b708cde9caa2e85a6041cabc3c4a20be.avif?t=1784209296\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in adrenaline-fueled battles, fighting off endless waves of enemies as you strive to survive. Complete various objectives, defeat the final boss, and earn the ultimate prizes. <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820820/extras/98de79f3e7ec8826498aa8f2cbb8e088.poster.avif?t=1784209296\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820820/extras/98de79f3e7ec8826498aa8f2cbb8e088.webm?t=1784209296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820820/extras/98de79f3e7ec8826498aa8f2cbb8e088.mp4?t=1784209296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820820/extras/a110bb90dffcbdd100dbe255de6bbd30.avif?t=1784209296\" width=616 height=100 /></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Take on challenging missions during each run to test your skills and enrich your journey through the mythic realms. These quests may involve completing specific objectives or overcoming additional obstacles as you battle relentless enemies on your way to the final challenge.  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820820/extras/1fce7b800f83a921456d4410c8a8ca0d.poster.avif?t=1784209296\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820820/extras/1fce7b800f83a921456d4410c8a8ca0d.webm?t=1784209296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820820/extras/1fce7b800f83a921456d4410c8a8ca0d.mp4?t=1784209296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820820/extras/616850032e5293ad641f5b05cc37d4dc.avif?t=1784209296\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your abilities with meta-progression systems that offer unlockable perks, in-game skills, or upgrades. As you progress further, you'll gain access to new abilities, weapons, and bonuses that allow you to customize your playstyle and improve your chances of survival. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820820/extras/45c2d352f61be3a9e984e266f2c278ad.poster.avif?t=1784209296\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820820/extras/45c2d352f61be3a9e984e266f2c278ad.webm?t=1784209296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820820/extras/45c2d352f61be3a9e984e266f2c278ad.mp4?t=1784209296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820820/extras/9ced63d4e700bd3054333b94ff093fc0.avif?t=1784209296\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from a roster of diverse characters, each equipped with unique skills, abilities, and weapons. Mix and match combinations to refine your builds and overcome the many challenges posed by the Hordes of Hel.  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820820/extras/867d8f368a823374c527567034da0bb7.poster.avif?t=1784209296\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820820/extras/867d8f368a823374c527567034da0bb7.webm?t=1784209296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820820/extras/867d8f368a823374c527567034da0bb7.mp4?t=1784209296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820820/extras/bc1af05775f5fc6e6ac203df73726e35.avif?t=1784209296\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a variety of increasingly challenging Boss enemies as you progress through the game. Outmaneuver and defeat these formidable foes using the environment, your skills, and abilities to gain the advantage and achieve victory. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820820/extras/16e274f324a0a638073f7fd0692adbca.poster.avif?t=1784209296\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820820/extras/16e274f324a0a638073f7fd0692adbca.webm?t=1784209296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820820/extras/16e274f324a0a638073f7fd0692adbca.mp4?t=1784209296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i7-6700 or AMD™ Ryzen 5 2600x<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 960 or Intel® Arc™ A380<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> System Requirements subject to change as development continues</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i7-8700 or AMD™ Ryzen 7 3700x<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 1060 or Intel® Arc™ A580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> System Requirements subject to change as development continues</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Indie","RPG"],"developers":["Games Farm","ARTillery"],"publishers":["Grindstone"],"release_date":"3 Sep, 2025"}